Package: tidyweave
Title: Composable R Workflows for Governed Data Products
Version: 0.12.0.9000
Authors@R: person("Jan-Hendrik", "Weinert", role = c("aut", "cre"), email = "65009403+JanWein@users.noreply.github.com")
Description: Composes checked data products from reusable product specifications,
    preparation recipes and execution workflows. Separates requirements from
    transformation instructions and operation engines through prefixed R verbs
    and interchangeable S3 adapters. Runs in memory and optionally publishes
    immutable releases through DuckDB or DuckLake. Supports lazy DBI sources,
    pointblank checks, dm relationships, dbt, metrics and retained report evidence.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
Depends: R (>= 4.2.0)
Imports: DBI, dplyr (>= 1.1.0), dbplyr, tibble, rlang, digest, jsonlite, methods, withr
Suggests: duckdb (>= 1.5.5), testthat (>= 3.0.0), pointblank, dm, shiny, bslib, yaml,
    readr, readxl, paws.storage, knitr, rmarkdown, processx, RPostgres,
    arrow, pins (>= 1.2.0), httr2, targets, renv, RSQLite, webfakes, bit64
